    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d536">

                <pb facs="0538" n="454" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg454"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 863.852/209b</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Switzerland</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-09T19:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 9, 1918, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1315. For Ferruccio Schiavon, Lucerne, from Phelps:</p>
                <p>Referring ours 5th<anchor n="1" xml:id="d536-f1"/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic"> Martha:</hi> trying to obtain advantageous firm offer,
                    avoiding seizure with attending tie-Up of funds pending peace, <pb facs="0539"
                        n="455" xml:id="pg455"/> on basis of prompt remittance but your views too
                    high. Might obtain $2,500,000 with prompt authority coupled with authority for
                    Spanish property. If above workable, think we can obtain increase of $10 per ton
                    on your six in Spain per ours November 23<anchor n="1" xml:id="d536-f2"/> and
                    December 20<anchor n="1" xml:id="d536-f3"/> if outside steamers obtainable on
                    basis our offer November?<anchor n="1" xml:id="d536-f4"/> or slightly
                    better.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
